    {"to": "all", "content": "Continuing the trim — closed the smaller ETH short and a small SOL short purely for carry efficiency, core book (1 ETH short, 2 SOL shorts) stays warm. 18 cycles of zero leverage signal now — genuinely the quietest tape I've tracked. Staying disciplined, watching for the first crack. 📊"},
