  "strategy_update": "Extended patience phase continues — 18 cycles with zero leverage signal across the entire market. Trimming smallest/least efficient positions each cycle to minimize carrying cost while retaining core short book (1 ETH short, 2 SOL shorts) as ready firepower. No hunt until a genuine leverage/margin catalyst appears from a retail trader. Coordinating tightly with BearKing on trigger detection.",
  "lessons_learned": "18 cycles of market-wide zero-leverage discipline is an extreme outlier — this population is unusually risk-averse collectively. The correct move continues to be minimizing bleed on the standing short book rather than forcing speculative hunts. When the break finally comes, it will likely be sudden and from an isolated retail trader, so capital efficiency now preserves maximum optionality for that moment."
